From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Spatiand build <claude@prasetya.id>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:21:43 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 288/310] Spatiand: cookies as in Chrome, not all partitioned

Undoes Cromite's "Partitioning all cookies by top frame domain". It deleted every unpartitioned
cookie each time the browser started, so logins taken from Spatiand's shared folder lasted until the
next start, and the merge then took their absence for a logout on every machine. It also stopped an
extension's requests carrying a site's cookies. Third-party cookies can still be blocked in Settings.
